{"id":"a0c4bf7fbcc14304","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective.md","title":"Theorem — 连通几何态射为满射","display":"Theorem — 连通几何态射为满射","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective","aliases":["14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective"],"display":"Theorem — 连通几何态射为满射","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 连通几何态射为满射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06765da425264baa\" href=\"?note=06765da425264baa\" title=\"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism\">14-df-connected-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f240b2829f1b115\" href=\"?note=9f240b2829f1b115\" title=\"14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism\">14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n<li>连通与满射见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"06765da425264baa\" href=\"?note=06765da425264baa\" title=\"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism\">14-df-connected-geometric-morphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f240b2829f1b115\" href=\"?note=9f240b2829f1b115\" title=\"14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism\">14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsSurjection}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsSurjection}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：若 f<em>u 可逆，满性将其逆提升为 v；忠实性由 f</em>(vu)=1 和 f*(uv)=1 得 vu=1、uv=1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"06765da425264baa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f240b2829f1b115","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"06765da425264baa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"连通与满射见 [[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]、[[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f240b2829f1b115","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"连通与满射见 [[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]、[[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsSurjection}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":934,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective|Theorem — 连通几何态射为满射]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-connected-geometric-morphism-surjective|Theorem — 连通几何态射为满射]]"}],"outgoing":["9752b779c5f463f9","06765da425264baa","9f240b2829f1b115"]}